          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Very hardy tree. Showy, fragrant spring flowers. Good shade tree. Fast growing. Mossy seed pods. Prone to scale and borers.</p>

