          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Slow growing. Blue-green needles, open, graceful growth. Pyramidal shape.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Plant in protected area. Spreading. Needs 30&#39; circle. Low survival rate in unprotected areas.</p>

