          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Striking checked pattern bark resembling alligator hide. Hard to find commercially.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Slow growing evergreen, very tolerant of drought. Male flowers produce large amounts of pollen that may affect those with allergies or asthma.</p>

