          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Shrubby form with grey, fibrous and shredding bark. Great for dry windy sites. Hard to find commercially.</p>

